        "type": "p-instruction",
        "title": "<h3> Protocol outline </h3>",
        "body_text": "<div class='text-start'><p>This study takes about 10 minutes and follows the structure outlined below:</p><div class='container-fluid text-center my-3'><div class='row justify-content-center'><div class='col-10 col-md-6 d-flex flex-column align-items-center'></div></div></div><p><u>1. Training & Practice:</u><br/>You will complete a quick comprehension check and a practice task. This stage does not count toward your bonus remuneration.</p><p><u>2. Main Experiment (2 Phases):</u><br/>The main study is split into 2 phases (4 tasks each) that count toward your score and bonus. A short feedback survey follows each phase.</p><p><u>3. Conclusion:</u><br/>A brief wrap-up survey completes the study protocol.</p><p class='text-muted mt-3'><em>Please review this information carefully\u2014you will not be able to return to this page once you continue.</em></p></div>",
        "button_text": "Continue",
        "with_button": "True"
    },
    {
        "type": "p-instruction",
        "title": "<img src='assets/res/img/SufficientInfo/5_timeline_hTraining.png' class='img-fluid' alt='timeline'><h3 align='left'>Second Task: Recognition with Increasing Levels of Clarity</h3>",
        "body_text": "<p align='justify'>You are now in the <b>Training Phase</b> (see timeline above). You will practice identifying images across 6 levels of clarity while reporting your confidence. <b>Note: Rewards shown in this training are simulated/hypothetical to help you get used to the interface.</b></p><p align='justify'>In the upcoming main experiment, your bonus will depend on both accuracy and confidence according to this payoff rule:</p><table class='table table-bordered table-sm text-center my-3' style='font-size: 0.85rem;'><thead class='table-light'><tr><th>Your Guess</th><th>Your Confidence</th><th>Result</th><th>Payout Impact</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Correct</b></td><td>High (100%)</td><td>Right</td><td class='text-success'><b>Maximum Bonus </b></td></tr><tr><td><b>Correct</b></td><td>Low (0%)</td><td>Right</td><td>Small Baseline</td></tr><tr><td><b>Incorrect</b></td><td>Low (0%)</td><td>Wrong</td><td>Small Penalty (Safe)</td></tr><tr><td><b>Incorrect</b></td><td>High (100%)</td><td>Wrong</td><td class='text-danger'><b>Severe Penalty </b></td></tr></tbody></table><p style='font-size: 0.9rem;'><b>Rule of thumb:</b> If you are unsure, use low confidence. Only claim high confidence when you are certain.</p>",
        "button_text": "Continue",
        "with_button": "True"
    },
