        "body_text": "<div class='text-start'><p>The practice section is over\u2014you are now entering the <b>Main Experiment</b> (see timeline above). From this point forward, <b>your performance counts toward your bonus remuneration (\u00a3)</b>.</p><p>This phase consists of <b>2 parts (4 tasks each)</b>, followed by short feedback surveys. Survey answers do not affect your bonus\u2014only your image classification accuracy and confidence calibration do.</p><p><b>Important Reminder:</b> Submit your answer before the 15-second timer runs out. Running out of time counts as an incorrect answer.</p><p><b>Warning:</b> Random guessing combined with high confidence will heavily penalize your bonus. If you are unsure, use low confidence.</p><p class='text-muted mt-2'><em>Tip: If any elements are cut off on your screen, use your browser zoom (Ctrl + mouse scroll or Ctrl and +/- keys) to adjust fit.</em></p></div>",
